OL,3,ARussian double-tap drone strike kills
OL,4,A15 in Ukrainian mall, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 15 people have been killed in
OL,7,Fa Russian double-tap drone strike on a
OL,8,Fshopping centre in the central
OL,9,FUkrainian city of Kryvyi Rih, local
OL,10,Fofficials have said.
OL,12,FAnother 130 people - including 23
OL,13,Fchildren - were injured in the city's
OL,14,Fbiggest mall. More people are also
OL,15,Freported to be trapped in the rubble.
OL,17,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,18,F"absolutely cynical and despicable"
OL,19,Fdaytime attack in his home town was
OL,20,Fcarried out in "two waves", with the
OL,21,Fsecond strike targeting emergency
OL,22,Fworkers at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
